.TH PSOuterProduct 3 2023-12-03 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSOuterProduct

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/maths.h>

.I
int  
.br
\fBPSOuterProduct\fR(\fIPSFloat *a\fR, \fIPSFloat *b\fR, \fIPSFloat *dest\fR, \fIuint64_t alen\fR, \fIuint64_t blen\fR, \fIPSMathOpts *opts\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Multiply every element of vector \fIa\fR (having \fIalen\fR length) by every element of vector \fIb\fR (having \fIblen\fR length) and store results into vector \fIdest\fR (whose length must be \fIalen\fR * \fIblen\fR).
